body:
Interesting use case, thanks for reporting!

It seems that here we would need to preserve the type signature when building `ConfigValidationMetadata` and use it to recreate the parameterized type for the List at runtime.
@mkouba I know Arc has a whole bunch of utilities to do similar things, which ones would be useful in this case?

> @mkouba what was your idea?

@radcortez  My idea was that we might store some info about the component type for collection types and handle them specifically in the recorder, which is basically a poor man's variant of passing the full type info as a recorder param.

> My question to @mkouba was which existing pieces should we just to do that?

@geoand And my answer was that I'm not aware of any existing "piece" ;-)
